cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Colorado school-level enrollment and teacher FTE archive"
message: "If you use this archive, please cite it and the underlying sources."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Keegan
    given-names: Brian C.
repository-code: "https://github.com/brianckeegan/charting-boulder"
url: "https://github.com/brianckeegan/charting-boulder/tree/main/2026-10-alternatives"
abstract: >-
  Annual Colorado public-school enrollment by grade with teacher full-time
  equivalents, plus a district-level panel reaching back to the 1977-78 school
  year. Built from Colorado Department of Education fall pupil membership and
  staff statistics, with the National Center for Education Statistics Common
  Core of Data harmonized alongside and reconciled school by school. The
  1986-1999 Colorado yearbooks are district grain only and were re-read from
  the page scans, because their embedded OCR layer loses most numeric columns.
keywords:
  - Colorado
  - public schools
  - enrollment
  - pupil membership
  - teacher full-time equivalents
  - school closures
  - education data
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-09-17"
